# Illustrative runtime scenario; verify it against model.d2 and requirements.
shape: sequence_diagram
customer: Customer
web: Web Application
api: Order API
database: Order Database
payment_provider: Payment Provider

customer -> web: Place order
web -> api: Submit order request
api -> database: Store pending order
api -> payment_provider: Request authorization
payment_provider -> api: Return result
api -> database: Record status
api -> web: Return outcome
web -> customer: Show outcome
